        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Helper method that calls the pre and post change notification responsible for clearing a property override.\nThis is the preferred way to clear property overrides because it will notify listeners\n@param Object owning the property to clear\n@param PropertyPath to the property to clear from the root of the specified object\n@return true if the property was successfully cleared."
